Ladies and gentlement,
%br

%p
  thank you for your ticket reservation for the BDZ eurofestial zupfmusik. We hve registered your order as number
  %b=@event_card.id


%p The tickets are deposited at the information desk in the Bürgerzentrum Bruchsal, and can be picked up starting #{@pickup_date}.
%p Find attached the invoice for your order.

- if @invoice.payment_method == "credit_card"
  %p
    %b The invoice is already paid.
- else
  %p
    %b We will debit the invoice amount from your bank account IBAN #{@invoice.customer.iban}, BIC #{@invoice.customer.bic} within the next few days.

Kind regards
%br
%br
Bund Deutscher Zupfmusiker e.V.
